>How is Yeenoghu useful after the Invocation?

Demon lords and princes are all covetous; they will attack *anyone* who
is carrying one or more plot tokens, with the Amulet taking priority,
and they'll use their special teleport powers to do so.  If all plot
tokens on the level are in his possession, the covetous monster will
then come after you.

Yeenoghu has a reasonable chance of taking the high priest to pieces
faster than you can cross the level; he'll then come after you with the
amulet in his inventory.
